      "description": "Anchored overlay with an arrow for rich content — a title, body text and optionally controls — opened from a trigger. 8 variants: placement (top, bottom, left, right) × size (sm, md). title and body are text props. Uses shadow/overlay at the overlay z level; dismisses on Esc or outside click; focus moves into it only when it contains controls. For a one-line hint use Tooltip; for a list of actions use Dropdown.",
